  "en": {
    "name": "LED and push button",
    "description": "Arduino Uno, a red LED with its 220 Ω resistor and a push button on a breadboard, wired by the auto-wiring. Hand-written program (Beginner mode): the LED is on while the button is pressed (INPUT_PULLUP input)."
  },
